  "description": "The Shoseian Teahouse, also known as the Whispering Pine Teahouse (the English translation of \"Shoseian\"), is a teahouse in Brand Park in Glendale, California. It is one of the only traditional Japanese teahouses that is available for public use in the U.S. The building is an important gathering place for the city's Japanese community.",
